OL,3,GNEWSAAndy Burnham says he is listening 
OL,4,Ato Wales amid devolution row           
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham has told   
OL,7,FMPs he is listening to Wales, a week   
OL,8,Fafter he refused to consider           
OL,9,Fsubstantial further powers for the     
OL,10,FSenedd.                                
OL,12,FTwo former Welsh Labour first ministers
OL,13,Fand the Plaid Welsh government         
OL,14,Fcomplained after the prime minister    
OL,15,Fsaid he was not persuaded of the case  
OL,16,Fto devolve justice, policing, rail     
OL,17,Finfrastructure or the Crown Estate.    
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
