OL,3,GNEWSAAndy Burnham says he is listening 
OL,4,Ato Wales amid devolution row           
OL,6,FThe prime minister said he will "never 
OL,7,Fcompletely rule things out" but said he
OL,8,Fwanted to work on devolving employment 
OL,9,Fsupport, where he said there was       
OL,10,F"common ground".                       
OL,12,FPlaid Cymru's Ann Davies MP said       
OL,13,FBurnham had "overruled the mandate     
OL,14,Fgiven by the people of Wales for more  
OL,15,Fresponsibility" at May's Senedd        
OL,16,Felection.                              
